  "description": "<p data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"799\">Beleef spectaculaire motorstunts in <strong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"267\">Trials Rising</strong>, een <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"318\">physics-based motorsport- en platformgame</strong> waarin precisie, timing en behendigheid centraal staan. Race over uitdagende parcoursen vol sprongen, hindernissen en bizarre constructies, verspreid over iconische locaties wereldwijd. Elke run draait om perfectie: hoe beter je controle hebt, hoe sneller je de finish bereikt.<br data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"599\">Deze Nintendo Switch-versie verkeert <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"654\">In Nette Staat</strong> en wordt geleverd met het <strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"701\">originele hoesje</strong>. Ideaal voor spelers die houden van snelle actie, technische uitdaging en eindeloze replaywaarde.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"804\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"822\">🎮 Highlights</h2>\r\n<ul data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<li data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"880\">\r\n<p data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"880\">🏍️ <strong data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"864\">Physics-based motorplatformgame</strong> vol spektakel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<p data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"938\">🌍 Parcours op realistische én fantasierijke locaties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1001\">\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1001\">💥 Uitdagende sprongen, hindernissen en technische secties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1055\">👥 Online leaderboards en multiplayer-uitdagingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1093\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1093\">📦 Inclusief <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1091\">origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1098\">\r\n<h2 data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1119\">📋 Specificaties</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1413\"><strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1133\">Platform:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1153\">Nintendo Switch</strong><br data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1156\"><strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1166\">Titel:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">Trials Rising</strong><br data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1187\"><strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1197\">Genre:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1239\">Motorsport / Platform / Physics-based</strong><br data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1242\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1251\">Taal:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1279\">Meertalig (o.a. Engels)</strong><br data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\"><strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1294\">Spelers:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1338\" data-is-only-node=\"\">1–2 lokaal, online functies beschikbaar</strong><br data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1341\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1354\">Conditie:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1373\">In Nette Staat</strong><br data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1376\"><strong data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1390\">Inclusief:</strong> <strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1411\">Origineel hoesje</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1418\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1447\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand</strong></p>",
